flowchart TD
    Start([User Logs In with Mobile & OTP]) --> FetchStatus[GET /api/devices/status/]
    FetchStatus --> CheckRegistered{Is this Device UUID registered?}
    CheckRegistered -- Yes --> CheckActive{Is status ACTIVE?}
    CheckActive -- Yes --> AllowAccess[Grant Access to Approvals Dashboard]
    CheckActive -- No / Revoked --> DenyForbidden[403 Forbidden: Device Revoked]

    CheckRegistered -- No --> CheckExistingActive{Does user already have another ACTIVE device?}
    CheckExistingActive -- No --> RegisterNew[POST /api/devices/register/\nStore UUID in SecureStore]
    RegisterNew --> AllowAccess

    CheckExistingActive -- Yes --> ShowConflict[409 Conflict: DEVICE_REPLACEMENT_REQUIRED]
    ShowConflict --> PromptReplace[Prompt: Replace Active Device?]
    PromptReplace -- User Cancels --> Terminate([Session Blocked])
    PromptReplace -- User Confirms --> ReqReplaceOTP[POST /api/devices/replace/request-otp/]
    ReqReplaceOTP --> EnterOTP[User enters 6-digit OTP sent to registered SIM]
    EnterOTP --> PostReplace[POST /api/devices/replace/]
    PostReplace --> RevokeOld[1. Mark Old Device REVOKED\n2. Invalidate Old Tokens\n3. Set active_user pointer to New Device]
    RevokeOld --> IssueToken[Issue Fresh Auth Token]
    IssueToken --> AllowAccess
